# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit .env.local.
#
# Waitlist form endpoint (Formspree form URL, e.g. https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx).
# Leave empty and the site shows an honest "waitlist not connected yet" state.
# This value ends up in the public JavaScript of a static site, so it is not a
# secret, but it still lives outside the repo. In GitHub, set it as a repository
# *variable* (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → Variables).
NEXT_PUBLIC_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=
